id: pm-gh1363
title: "GH-1363: Plan: lightweight defaults with opt-in capabilities and complete agent discovery"
description: "Residual SDK contract and acceptance plan imported from https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1363. Preserve existing shipped foundations. Detailed source observations are dated 2026-09-30 and must be revalidated before implementation."
type: Plan
status: open
priority: 2
