acceptance_criteria: "Fresh non-Git generic workflow succeeds without packages, claims, tests, Git warnings or coding-only instructions; Fresh Git workspace can use the same minimal core without silently installing/requiring optional integrations; Disabled / optional / required states are consistent across SDK, CLI, MCP, init, health and validation; Required integration failures remain failing; stricter exit handling does not independently change capability policy; Legacy migration is explicit, preserves configured safety and user-owned files, and documents recovery; Compact discovery reaches all installed/custom capabilities; full-detail and continuation paths are executable; Mandatory constraints, blockers and incomplete-context outcomes remain visible in compact output; Packed Node/Bun consumers and CLI/MCP parity cover minimal, extended, legacy, malformed-setting and custom-type fixtures; The 36-trajectory comparison reports total agent effort and correct outcomes, separately from scripted output-token estimates; Existing quality, security, coverage, completeness and token ratchets remain intact"
